        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Use, computer, laptop, office use</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Use, computer, laptop, office use
The laptop computer office use is calculated according to the share between active (5.5 hrs/day), standby (2 hrs/day) and off (16.5 hrs/day) modes taken from literature information.;
Synonyms: Notebook, Lifebook; 
UUID: b0e12f5a-63a7-34fe-9ceb-0c213ac015fb
Describes the use of a laptop computer in an office. Calculated per 1 hour of laptop use in an office. Swiss supply mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: No technology involved, except for the production of the laptop computer, which is described in another dataset.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, producer information and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: Daily experiences confirm retrieved data from literature.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b0e12f5a-63a7-34fe-9ceb-0c213ac015fb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
